9:["$","$L4b",null,{"children":"flowchart LR\n  B[\"Bazel / Buck2 / recc\"] -->|CAS + AC + ByteStream :50051| CAS\n  B -->|Execution + Capabilities :50052| SCH\n  CAS[[\"CAS process<br/>CAS + AC + ByteStream\"]]\n  SCH[[\"Scheduler process<br/>queue + matching\"]]\n  W[[\"Worker process<br/>runs the actions\"]]\n  SCH -->|reads/writes blobs over gRPC| CAS\n  W -->|worker_api :50061| SCH\n  W -->|blobs over gRPC :50051| CAS\n  CAS --> D[(\"filesystem or object store\")]"}]
